# Admin settings scope. The rest of the environment list is nextjs/.env.template.
# Copy that file to .env.local. This file documents ADMIN_SETTINGS_APP_KEY.
#
# Leave unset for a single-app starter. Existing and seeded rows use app_key NULL
# and keep working with no extra config.
# On a shared database, set a unique value (for example my-site) and copy rows
# for that key. See the root README, "Admin settings on a shared database".
# Server-only. Do not prefix with NEXT_PUBLIC_.
ADMIN_SETTINGS_APP_KEY=
